ication/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570529329591028,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"072e08bb-75ad-49b9-8e0d-5393935fd392","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"ad92-dadf-b0fa-43da"},{"link_uuid":"01511ac2-3189-4a0b-ab34-f72d8db6af2a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"fdea-9745-e4de-4326"},{"link_uuid":"f35967e3-7650-4073-b4d8-a218ca5ebf7c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"c1e6-3b0d-c1da-4e59"},{"link_uuid":"6761f437-ffa9-44b8-a4e5-637995725d27","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"314e-07c6-57cc-40d5"},{"link_uuid":"af6f1db1-db64-4c81-b437-e14178de7dd5","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"e8ae-ef90-bbe0-4d37"},{"link_uuid":"e68c5d26-3503-4ca2-a3ea-d1147b83bc10","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"36c8-489b-7df0-4cf0"},{"link_uuid":"87474865-b4d8-4407-9cc6-137a467a558b","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f724-651f-1cab-43b0"},{"link_uuid":"263160b9-bdb1-4733-b13e-2fa987c9d381","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"62cf-bae4-68cb-4573"},{"link_uuid":"1c9e036b-0cdb-4f35-8218-62f939c22da0","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"4298-b694-a0f8-403d"},{"link_uuid":"eff363d2-9c99-4df2-8a5a-5e9980d88c97","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d4b9-37a1-96e3-4edd"},{"link_uuid":"41d192be-80ea-4a03-958b-7ce34b9ad68a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"c0d2-bcee-47c5-45f6"},{"link_uuid":"48cd53a8-f6b4-4f59-9fc9-0da259743bc5","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"427d-b94c-cbcd-445d"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe infra/scripts cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:1-36,49-274,307-366,405-456,468-561,617-740,811-871,908-1019,1057-1108,1158-1316` — Preserve component markers/backoff, drain and readiness bounds, disk-pressure state, path-trigger sets, secret refresh ordering, blue-green pointer swap/rollback, proof-before-stop rules, health/write probes, observability materialization. Consumer: systemd/operators/tests that inspect constants.\n- `infra/scripts/bootstrap-gerrit-admin.sh:1-23,32-37` — Preserve one-time account/bootstrap purpose, secret handling, idempotency, required account check. Consumer: operators.\n- `infra/scripts/compose-up.sh:1-12,24-40,78-90,102-159,190-214` — Preserve authoritative site-subdir list/enumeration mode, bind-volume creation, scratch markers, one-time plugin seed, fail-closed config materialization. Consumer: operators/config checks.\n- `infra/scripts/config-check.sh:1-22,71-99` — Preserve deterministic config validation scope, YAML parsing policy, volume/source parity and drift check. Consumer: deployment gate/operators.\n- `infra/scripts/fetch-secrets.sh:1-37,121-155,170-234,276-280` — Preserve required versus optional reads, fallback rules, always-create file semantics, file modes, bearer/Jira materialization, deliberate env omission. Consumer: boot/deployment scripts.\n- `infra/scripts/install-autodeploy.sh:1-16` — Preserve idempotent unit install, mirror bootstrap, timer intentionally disabled pending manual verification. Consumer: operators.\n- `infra/scripts/install-certbot-timer.sh:1-24` — Preserve host nginx, dnf/venv fallback, HTTP-01 webroot, twice-daily renewal/reload, args/idempotency. Consumer: operators.\n- `infra/scripts/materialize-mcp-upstream.sh:1-28` — Preserve validated target format, atomic include generation, safe default/failure behavior, inputs. Consumer: nginx/autodeploy.\n- `infra/scripts/materialize-opcert-guard.sh:1-37` — Preserve secret source, hash/map output, file permissions, atomic replacement, fail-closed empty/missing behavior. Consumer: nginx/operators.\n- `infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh:1-27,34-54,82-85,106-168,229-264,320-362` — Preserve persistent ticket/code clones, lock discipline, relative deletion safety, credential-helper isolation, clone validation/convergence, no secret logging. Consumer: MCP container.\n- `infra/scripts/observability.sh:1-40,74-127,145-228,259-302,335-390,444-550,568-652,659-725,737-826` — Preserve metric contracts, unconditional heartbeats, missing/log-rotation handling, bounded process census, offsets/deltas, MCP/reviewbot/g2p/autodeploy failure signals, mirror divergence and exit behavior. Consumer: systemd/CloudWatch alarms/operators.\n- `infra/scripts/reviewbot-ensure-tickets.sh:1-27,55-74,164-167` — Preserve durable tickets clone, global identity necessity, full-history convergence, ensure-registry invocation. Consumer: review-bot container.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/bootstrap-gerrit-admin.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/compose-up.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/config-check.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/fetch-secrets.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/install-autodeploy.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/install-certbot-timer.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/materialize-mcp-upstream.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/materialize-opcert-guard.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/observability.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/scripts/reviewbot-ensure-tickets.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"0165-f432-0580-4117","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in infra/scripts","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e958286b-17e2-43eb-acc2-669dd60601b6","604c0d7c-0ed4-4c7c-a181-d3a7ebdf4163","072e08bb-75ad-49b9-8e0d-5393935fd392","01511ac2-3189-4a0b-ab34-f72d8db6af2a","f35967e3-7650-4073-b4d8-a218ca5ebf7c","6761f437-ffa9-44b8-a4e5-637995725d27","af6f1db1-db64-4c81-b437-e14178de7dd5","e68c5d26-3503-4ca2-a3ea-d1147b83bc10","87474865-b4d8-4407-9cc6-137a467a558b","263160b9-bdb1-4733-b13e-2fa987c9d381","1c9e036b-0cdb-4f35-8218-62f939c22da0","eff363d2-9c99-4df2-8a5a-5e9980d88c97","41d192be-80ea-4a03-958b-7ce34b9ad68a","48cd53a8-f6b4-4f59-9fc9-0da259743bc5"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582453733373001,"uuid":"5a2906d7-d4c8-4170-8734-00a94a037086"}